{"message":"You can’t use a referral for your roommate because Rho-Bank’s rules prohibit referrals when the referrer and referred person are registered at the same address.

If that restriction didn’t apply, the best fit for a roughly $600 paycheck would be the Green Fee-Free Account: you would receive $20 and she would receive $35, for a combined $55. It requires a new-money deposit of at least $300 within 60 days, and the deposit must remain for at least 30 additional days after the qualifying period. The Light Blue Account would total $50 ($30 + $20) and requires $500.

Your referral history also shows referrals dated 11/04/2025 and 11/10/2025; referrals are subject to a maximum of two bonuses in any rolling nine-day window. Referral bonuses cannot be combined with another new-account promotion."}
